---
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>SEO Services | Mitchell Haw</title>
    <meta name="description" content="SEO strategy, technical SEO, content planning, local SEO, and organic growth support from Mitchell Haw in Bend, Oregon." />
  </head>

  <body>
    <Header />

    <main>
      <section class="page-hero">
        <div class="container narrow">
          <p class="section-label">SEO Services</p>
          <h1>SEO strategy that helps your business get found.</h1>
          <p>
            I help businesses improve rankings, organic traffic, content visibility,
            local search presence, and technical SEO foundations.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="services">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="service-grid three">
            <div class="card">
              <h3>Technical SEO</h3>
              <p>Site structure, crawlability, indexation, metadata, internal linking, redirects, schema, and migration support.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
              <h3>Content Strategy</h3>
              <p>Keyword research, page planning, topic clusters, FAQs, service pages, location pages, and blog strategy.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
              <h3>Local SEO</h3>
              <p>Google Business Profile optimization, local landing pages, maps visibility, reviews, and citation cleanup.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="intro">
        <div class="container narrow">
          <h2>Built for long-term organic growth.</h2>
          <p>
            Good SEO is not just about ranking for one keyword. It is about making your website
            easier for search engines, AI platforms, and real customers to understand.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact" class="primary-btn">Reach Out</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
